Usage: deq flag [options]

Draw the flag of Kurdistan.

Options:
      --variant <variant>      Flag variant. Default full-color. Values:
                               full-color, mono-black, mono-white, outline,
                               high-contrast, square.
      --width <px>             Width in px, 1 to 8192; the height follows.
                               Default 900.
      --format <format>        Output format. Default svg. Values: svg, png,
                               jpg, webp.
      --title <text>           Accessible title. Default "Flag of Kurdistan".
      --current-color <color>  What currentColor means in image formats. Default
                               black.
      --matte <color>          JPG background behind transparent pixels. Default
                               white.
      --quality <0-100>        JPG and WebP quality. Default 90.
      --out <path>             Output file or directory; - writes to stdout.
                               Default: the current directory.
      --force                  Overwrite existing files.
  -h, --help                   Show help.
  -V, --version                Print the version.
